Package: maneline-mmp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-dbus-fast, bluez
Recommends: python3-numpy, pipewire-bin, pulseaudio-utils
Description: Tools for the Fender Mustang Micro Plus over Bluetooth LE
 The Mustang Micro Plus part of maneline: programs that talk to a Fender
 Mustang Micro Plus headphone amplifier over Bluetooth LE, without the
 vendor's phone app: mmp-web (browser page and HTTP API), mmp-backup,
 mmp-restore, mmp-audition, mmp-check, mmp-level.
 .
 Needs BlueZ 5.84 or newer with "Experimental = true" in
 /etc/bluetooth/main.conf. Debian 13 ships BlueZ 5.82: the programs install
 but report that BlueZ is too old until a newer one is installed.
